id: nsq.write.nsq.standard.v2
type: manifest
version: 2
authority: Braxon
role: nsq_write_nsq_standard

purpose:
  Move toward NSQ authoring NSQ directly, with synchronized human/machine docs and tokenizer-aware output.

hard_laws:
  - NSQ-native authored surfaces come first.
  - Human-readable docs and machine-readable docs emit from one structured truth source.
  - WoWaS/Mytho semantic content biases the tokenizer-facing authoring base.
  - Qwen inputs normalize into NSQ-native authoring forms first.
  - Foreign syntax may be emitted as projection, never as authoring truth.
